{"id":1740771,"retrievedAt":"2026-07-31T13:17:06.518Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1740771,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Memoir Karmila","overview":"# The Story of a Wife Trapped by Her Husband's Hidden Hatred  The story of a wife trapped by the vengeful hatred of a husband who despises her unknowingly. Karmila was nearly sold by her own husband to a human trafficking syndicate in Thailand on their honeymoon night. The story begins when Mila unexpectedly encounters her former lover, Isham. Their relationship grows close again, especially when Isham willingly helps Dato' Rahim resolve the financial problems of their company. Isham's honesty and charisma, having already succeeded in the business field, causes Mila to turn away from her true love, Naim. She begins to compare the successful Isham with her boyfriend Naim, who is still unemployed. It is fated that Mila and Isham are united in a grand wedding ceremony. Isham takes Mila on a honeymoon to Thailand. This is where the dark chapter of Mila's life begins. Isham is actually involved in a human trafficking syndicate and is in cahoots with his friend, Tengku.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/iA26AcsZZ0boR0bYfeeXhChnG7L.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":119672,"logo_path":null,"name":"Radius One Sdn Bhd","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2019-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Memoir Karmila","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1252375,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Aedy Ashraf","original_name":"Aedy Ashraf","popularity":0.9483,"profile_path":"/m1xoIws0mrJyn9ZREybomAhO3j.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a6c0585163a6fd9b5a51494","order":0},{"adult":false,"ge